  "type": "manhwa",
  "description": "The bond of family can be a star that guides us in the night, or a chain that drags us down. For aspiring hunter Seung-Hyeon Gi, both are true. He dreams of becoming a legendary hunter like his father, despite his bitterness at his family’s preoccupation with his comatose sister, So-Hyeon. Everything changes when So-Hyeon suddenly regains consciousness and reveals herself as a ‘Homecomer’, possessing powerful abilities from transmigrating to another world while comatose. Seung-Hyeon realizes that if he wants to protect his sister, he'll need to grow stronger, and there’s no better place than the Seong-Han Academy for the Gifted…\n\n(Source: WEBTOON)",
